	<body>
		<div class="container">
			<div
				class="wrapper">

				{# page 1 #}
				<div class="page page-1">
					<img class="bg" src="{{ images[1] }}" alt="image">

					<a class="logo" href="https://www.bondy.earth/" target="_blank">
						<img src="{{ images[2] }}" alt="logo">
					</a>

					<img class="title" src="{{ images['title'] }}" alt="title">

					<div class="title_text">to make your company bond with nature.</div>

					<div class="logo_wrapper">
						<img class="logo_partner" src="{{ convert_file_to_base64(user.logo) }}" alt="logo partner">
					</div>

					<a class="link" target="_blank" href="https://www.bondy.earth/">www.bondy.earth</a>
				</div>

				{# page 2 #}
				<div class="page page-2">
					<img class="background" src="{{ images['background'] }}" alt="image">

					<img class="mini-logo" src="{{ images[0] }}" alt="mini-logo">

					<img class="ceo" src="{{ images[3] }}" alt="ceo">

					<div class="text_ceo">
						<h2 class="title">Message from the CEO</h2>

						<p>At Bôndy, we firmly believe that landscape restoration can only be achieved through strong and
																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											                    committed collaborations. This is why we are proud to build strategic partnerships that share our
																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											                    vision of regenerative agriculture and sustainable resource management.</p>

						<p>This partnership marks a significant milestone in our commitment to reconciling economic performance
																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											                    with positive environmental impact. Together, we are developing innovative solutions that create
																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											                    value both for local communities and for the ecosystems we strive to protect.</p>

						<p>This collaboration strengthens our conviction that concrete and ambitious actions can make a real
																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											                    difference. We are eager to continue this momentum and amplify our impact, hand in hand.</p>

						<p>Together, let’s build a more resilient and sustainable future.</p>

						<div class="ceo_name">Gabriel Tasso</div>

					</div>
				</div>

				{# page 3 repete la page 3 #}

				{% if projectChildList is not empty %}
					{% for projectChild in projectChildList %}
						{% include 'admin/pdf/page/page-project.html.twig' with { 'projectChild': projectChild, 'images': images } %}
					{% endfor %}
				{% endif %}

				{# page 4 #}
				<div class="page page-4">
					<img class="background" src="{{ images['background'] }}" alt="image">

					<img class="mini-logo" src="{{ images[0] }}" alt="mini-logo">


					<div class="logo_wrapper">
						<img class="logo_partner" src="{{ convert_file_to_base64(user.logo) }}" alt="logo partner">
					</div>

					<div class="nombre_arbre">
						<strong>{{ totalTreeCount|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
						<p>Growing trees</p>
					</div>

					<img class="image-bottom" src="{{ images[6] }}" alt=" image">

				</div>

				{# page 5 repete la page 5 #}
				<div class="page page-5">
					<img class="background" src="{{ images['background'] }}" alt="image">

					<img class="mini-logo" src="{{ images[0] }}" alt="mini-logo">

					<img class="top-logo" src="{{ convert_file_to_base64(user.logo) }}" alt="logo partener">

					<h2>Your impacts</h2>

					<div class="vert">
						<img class="bg" src="{{ images['vert'] }}" alt="vert">

						<img class="icon" src="{{ images['vert_icon'] }}" alt="icon">

						<div class="text">
							environmental
						</div>


						<div class="line line-1">
							<strong>{{ totalTreeCount|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
							<p>trees planted</p>
						</div>


						<div class="line line-2">
							<strong>{{ projectMetrics.TCO2Sequestered|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
							<p>TCO2 sequestered
								<span>(over 20 years)</span>
							</p>
						</div>


					</div>

					<div class="rouge">
						<img class="bg" src="{{ images['rouge'] }}" alt="rouge">

						<img class="icon" src="{{ images['rouge_icon'] }}" alt="rouge">

						<div class="text">economic</div>


						<div class="line line-1">
							<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalSustainableEmployment|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
							<p>Sustainable employment</p>
						</div>


						<div class="line line-2">
							<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalRestoredHectares|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
							<p>Restored hectares, generating an economic opportunity</p>
						</div>

					</div>

					<div class="orange">
						<img class="bg" src="{{ images['orange'] }}" alt="orange">

						<img class="icon" src="{{ images['orange_icon'] }}" alt="orange">

						<div class="text">social</div>

						{% if projectMetrics.totalPartnerFarmers > 0 %}
							<div class="line line-1">
								<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalPartnerFarmers|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
								<p>Partner farmers</p>
							</div>
							<div class="line line-2">
								<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalSeasonalJobs|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
								<p>Seasonal jobs</p>
							</div>
							<div class="line line-3">
								<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalIndirectBeneficiaries|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
								<p>Indirect beneficiaries</p>
							</div>
						{% else %}
							<div class="line line-1">
								<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalSeasonalJobs|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
								<p>Seasonal jobs</p>
							</div>
							<div class="line line-2">
								<strong>{{ projectMetrics.totalIndirectBeneficiaries|number_format(0, ' ', ' ') }}</strong>
								<p>Indirect beneficiaries</p>
							</div>
						{% endif %}
					</div>
				</div>

				{# page 6 chart ici #}
